# Minimal nuclear-on case (NUCRE 1) for the --score-replicas equivalence tests.
# One TEXT mesh output so run_score_replicas.cmake can compare data columns.

Geometry Mesh
   Name MyMesh                    # geometry type
    X -5.0    5.0    1
    Y -5.0    5.0    1
    Z  0.0   20.0  200   # 1 mm steps

Output
         Filename NB_msh.dat
         Fileformat TEXT
         Geo MyMesh
         Quantity Energy
         Quantity Dose
